# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for builds with PULSETEN_SANITIZE=thread.
#
# PULSETEN_SANITIZE instruments PulseTen, not DuckDB. With libstdc++, the
# linker may give DuckDB the instrumented copy of an inline template such as
# std::shared_ptr's reference count, while the synchronization of DuckDB's
# task scheduler stays invisible to TSan. The reports this produces involve
# only DuckDB frames, so races with a DuckDB frame in a stack are not
# reported; PulseTen's own code is still checked.
race:duckdb::
